{"game":"Memory of Goddess (NKS)","id":"story-snowwhite","title":"RECORD #01 WHITE SHOULD BE WHITE","group":"Story","count":30,"sections":[{"type":"facts","items":[["Plays in",[{"page":"stages-mog-1","label":"Snowy Land- I (M.O.G.)"}]],["Play as",[{"page":"char-1","label":"Snow White"}]],["Carrying",[{"img":"nks_item_field_17","caption":"Dog Tag","size":"small"}]]]},{"type":"table","columns":["Speaker","Line"],"rows":[["",{"img":"nks_sbg_02","size":"large"}],["",{"b":"RECORD #01\nWHITE SHOULD BE WHITE"}],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Red Hood! Look, look!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Hmm?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"What am I supposed to be looking at?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"At this! The dog tag."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"I just got it."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"It's just a dog tag, what are you so happy about?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Cause it means that now I'm officially a member of the Goddess Squad!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"You do realize what dog tags are meant to be used for, don't you?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Aren't they for identification? Your name, squad, stuff like that?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"That's true, but there's something else you're forgetting."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"When we're on the battlefield, there are bullets and missiles flying around every which way."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"What happens if you get hit by one?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"It'd hurt really bad."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"More than that. If you get hit, your entire body will..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"??"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"You're right. It'd hurt like a mother, so you can use your dog tag to block projectiles."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Really? This little thing?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"You bet. It may be small, but it makes for an A-plus shield."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"... You're pulling my leg."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Haha, I should have known you wouldn't fall for that one."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"So tell me, what are dog tags really for?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"They're just meant to make you look cool."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Do I look cool right now?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"You bet you do."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Super cool."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Hehehe."]]}]}